  message: "ADR-0051 annotation (WI-virav; annotate only -- no fold, no closure, no re-prioritisation). CLAUSE VIOLATED: \"not a property of the call site: not the receiver's variable name\". NOTION THE SLOT CARRIES: receiver_variable (section call_site_property). ADR-0051 s2 is this item stated as principle; the module-key audit sized it (1,102 of 4,207 objc+swift refs, 26%, 266 distinct locals) and located objc's literal `module_path=receiver_name`. The conformant value -- the receiver TYPE -- already has a home in `receiver_type_hint`; WI-monul is the consumer half."  # bf61
